    {
      "id": "claim_f90ae78fab7044ddb357321da9399ae2",
      "statement": "The release job derives its new_release_published and new_release_version outputs by comparing the newest v* tag before and after running semantic-release, because npx semantic-release writes nothing to $GITHUB_OUTPUT and the previously assumed outputs came from an action this workflow does not use — leaving the build-trigger job evaluating an empty string and skipping on every release.",
